rces. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"However, Narciss and Morridow still stand in their way, like two mighty peaks that cannot be scaled. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The Dolls have pushed their bodies to the limit. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"They stand in front of the Commander and Dandelion, their bodies covered in fresh blood."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_whitenoise","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Pzzzt... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"There is still no response from the communicator."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Do you regret going on this mission with me?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Carrying out missions under your command has been the greatest honor of my life, Commander."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I, on the other hand, regret not having a few more drinks with you, Commander."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I... I want to see M4 and M16 again!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander gazes at the overwhelming number of Paradeus reinforcements, as well as Morridow and Narciss, who stand among them."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Even if we die here... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You will never succeed. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"There is no path for Paradeus which does not end in its destruction. "}]},{"spans":[{"t